2026-11-09T15:33:31.3013969Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3014397Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3033257Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3033416Z I will:
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3034160Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3034401Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3034801Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3035092Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3035480Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3035756Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3036026Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3036320Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3036544Z    /root
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3058838Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3059222Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3080962Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3081488Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3081728Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3085759Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3086251Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3114265Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3114713Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3133131Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3133594Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3133963Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134131Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134282Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134432Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134549Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134790Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134915Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3134987Z If you would like to
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3135154Z see the output, try like this:
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3135276Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3135520Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3135734Z   $ sh ./install-nix
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3135836Z 
2026-11-09T15:33:31.3137851Z 
